sive** | Weighted toward the documented leakage/earnings/reclassification mechanics, not an arithmetic average | Instrument-only legal-risk judgment; no market-relative conclusion or governance-score substitution |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 186","text":"Market-norm and third-party covenant-review comparison is limited because no supported comparative source was provided. The rubric's score labels are analytical categories, not evidence that this document is better/worse than a dated bond peer cohort. No independent confidence-score script or unavailable local validation is claimed; the source/instruction submission check is separate from host evidence review.","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 188","text":"#### Conflicts and definition boundaries","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 190","text":"| Issue | Exact competing observations | Treatment / downstream effect |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 191","text":"|---|---|---|","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 192","text":"| Accounting versus legal debt | CP-1 K07 carrying debt 24,880 includes securitization and finance leases; legal Total Indebtedness uses principal and bespoke preferred/guarantee/lien obligations and excludes specified Securitization Entity debt (L p.6 L445) | Definition difference, not accounting error. Do not substitute K07 or ordinary gross debt for legal secured numerator; no forced reconciliation |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 193","text":"| Accounting versus legal earnings/cash | CP