mber 15. |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 197","text":"| Designated Senior Debt reference | \u00a711.15 L p.29 L2088 cites February 13,2019 indenture for 7.50% notes while designating for 5.50%/2029 notes; form reverse p.37 L2779 cites November 13,2019 for 5.50% | Preserve textual discrepancy. Main indenture controls form conflict under form \u00a74 L2706, but missing subordinated instruments prevent certifying their blockage/priority terms |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 198","text":"| Automatic insolvency acceleration wording | Operative \u00a76.02 L1512 limits automatic acceleration to Company events; form summary p.36 L2755 also mentions Significant Subsidiaries | Use operative provision, consistent with form's indenture-controls language; do not promote broader summary into control finding |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 199","text":"| Inherited accounting alignments | CP-1/CP-1A lease wording conflict, cash-bridge residuals 30/16 and dividend comparison (18) remain unresolved | Keep scopes separate; none is a legal basket usage correction. No accounting recalculation here |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 200","text":"| Non-debt operating funding | CP-1 ND01 reports contract liabilities 168/79 at 2024/2023; Indebtedness excludes ordinary accrued liabilities and has specified purchase-adjustment/license exclusions (L p.7) | Operating float remains cash-relevant even when not a basket debt item; exact contractual classification of advances/customer deposits needs reconciliation, not wholesale reclassification of payables |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note