ult.","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 212","text":"Retained CP-1 quantities: consolidated carrying debt September 30, 2024/2023 **24,880/19,750** USD million (K07); reported cash **6,261/3,472** (BS01); reported annual EBITDA As Defined FY2024/FY2023/FY2022 **4,173/3,395/2,646** (SG16); analyst carrying-debt/EBITDA As Defined **5.962138/5.817378** for 2024/2023 (K09); mechanical cash-netted multiples **4.461778/4.794698** (K10). These values retain CP-1's cited S1 pp.105,126\u2013127,142 and definitions. They are not used as legal test operands. FY2022 balance-dependent leverage is Not calculable because a debt instant is Not supplied. No zero substitutes for a missing year or usage.","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 214","text":"| Legal calculation | Governing formula / threshold | Current calculation / headroom | Reason / required inputs |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 215","text":"|---|---|---|---|","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 216","text":"| Ratio debt FCCR | Legal EBITDA / legal Fixed Charges, pro forma, **>2.0**; \u00a74.09 and \u00a71.01 | Not calculable \u2014 legal ratio inputs and transaction certificate Not supplied | Restricted-group four quarters, adjustment bridge, fixed-charge preferred/interest items, transaction/rates/hedges and debt proceeds use |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 217","text":"| Any-RP FCCR | Same legal ratio **>2.0**, no continuing Default/EoD and pro forma payment; \u00a74.07 | Not calculable \u2014 no qualifying-date legal certificate/default evidence | Declaration/commitment/payment dates, obligations,