orrowing / summed leakage | Separate lawful routes and independent usability required | Not calculable \u2014 neither unused capacity nor independence established | Do not add overlapping/refreshed baskets or subtract current financial debt from an untested contractual basket |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 224","text":"Financial accounting remains separate from legal definitions even when both cite GAAP. The lack of capacity calculations is a required-input gap, not zero capacity, adverse evidence or proof of no headroom.","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 226","text":"## Gaps","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 228","text":"### Legal gaps","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 230","text":"The executed full indenture is supplied and reviewed; it is **not** a missing input. Remaining gaps prevent a whole-package opinion, exact available capacity, perfection certification and security-selection implementation. The most material missing evidence is the controlling ICA/security/facility package and contemporaneous transaction-level calculation/election ledger. These gaps should be resolved by targeted requests, not by extrapolating the annual report or requesting the supplied indenture again.","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 232","text":"| Gap / priority | Missing data or limitation | Why it matters / affected output | Required follow-up |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 233","text":"|---|---|---|---|","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,