umber_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 569","text":"| CP-1D earnings quality | Reported EB/NB/CB bridges, all adjustments and descriptions, CFO and capex, cash interest/taxes, leases, R27\u2013R29 and recurring compensation context | Suitable starting evidence, not completed challenge. Test each add-back's cash content/recurrence and resolve required scope alignments; no automatic acceptance of issuer adjusted EBITDA. |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 570","text":"| CP-2 fundamental credit | Annual financials, calculated leverage/coverage/conversion, historical cash/debt/facility/maturity observations and material non-debt funding stories | Annual historical synthesis supported with limitations. Cash netting is mechanical, post-event liquidity not built, legal headroom/current credit/forecast conclusions not supported. |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 571","text":"| CP-MODEL publication | Complete five-statement extraction with supplements, period/quantity register, stable IDs, account mappings, source dashboard and separate calculation traces | Bounded annual publication may proceed only after host evidence/presentation review. Preserve blanks and reasons, original source dashes, equity shares, definitions and subsequent-event dates. No Model/charts/JSON delivery or validation is claimed here. |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 572","text":"| CP-4 legal | Annual accounting perimeter, carrying/principal distinction, maturities, reported issuer compliance language and supplied 2033 indenture document boundary | Use supplied legal-text under CP-0's pinned identity, not annual EBITDA as capacity. Financial facts do not certify current basket usage, guarantees, perfection or whole-package covenant compliance. |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 573","text":"| CP-6 committee | Historical accounting evidence, documented funding/distribution facts and explicit limitations after required downstream handoffs | Not decision-ready: current analytical challenge, market/portfolio/forecast and legal-capacity inputs remain constrained. No clearance, sizing or mandate conclusion. |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 575","text":"Immediate next action is host source/instruction review of this retained CP-1 artifact, followed by CP-1A or the next selected module under the existing CP-OS workflow. Fresh consumers can use S1's exact source key/hash/path and the located rows directly; no older campaign handoff is needed. CP-3C owns refinancing, CP-4 legal and CP-6 committee work. This file is the financial foundation, not completion of their analyses or delivery. All eighteen selected T4 responsibilities are covered above; T4.7 is not part of the selected catalog.","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null}],"limitation":"Actual analytical handoff; underlying source qualifications and scope remain.","extractor":"literal-markdown-lines","extraction_status":"complete","coverage":[]},{"schema_version":"source/1","source_id":"current_synthesis","name":"current_synthesis.md","status":"ready","sha256":"46cca7cd74c612c8c29b7d89c572a46c1e86481a387bd1301525e3e440b3ae1c","media_type":"text/markdown","spans":[{"locator":"line 1","text":"# CP-2 \u2014 TransDigm Group Incorporated \u2014 historical fundamental credit synthesis","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 3","text":"## Request","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 5","text":"Run `sol-fresh-tdg-complete-20261105`; CP-2, attempt 1; DeployV-r14 ancestry and current Markdown instructions. Execution date: November 5, 2026. Issuer: **TransDigm Group Incorporated (TD Group) and consolidated subsidiaries**, including controlled majority-owned subsidiaries and noncontrolling interests, with intercompany balances and transactions eliminated. Accounting basis: U.S. GAAP; monetary presentation: USD millions unless explicitly stated otherwise.","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 7","text":"The historical base is **September 30, 2024**, with FY2022, FY2023 and FY2024 annual durations. This is retrospective analysis, not current 2026 underwriting or a timely-availability 2024 backtest. October 2024 events disclosed in the annual report are separately dated subsequent events. No December quarterly case is supplied. This module synthesizes the supplied checked CP-0, CP-1 and CP-1A handoffs; it does not claim to have executed those modules or independently re-extracted their evidence.","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 9","text":"Reuse CP-0's **ready with limitations** annual-source foundation and CP-1A's **ready with limitations for historical synthesis** judgment. The scope is a creditor-oriented fundamental view, not an agency/composite rating, security recommendation, default probability, recovery outcome, covenant certification or investment clearance. Confidence remains below High because material inherited restrictions remain.","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 11","text":"## Sources","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 13","text":"### Exact current handoff identities and evidence hierarchy","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 15","text":"All three complete current handoffs supplied for this invocation were consumed, including their financial definitions, business/governance registers, conflicts, gaps and consumer restrictions. The following are supplied SHA256 identities, not independently rehashed bytes.","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 17","text":"| Current handoff | Exact supplied SHA256 | Analytical use |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 18","text":"|---|---|---|","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 19","text":"| CP-0 | `8a0611cc768e043abd52c2bf4899f6b0a6d560a1c264f7fbc991fa6d10863963` | Source readiness, effective source set, perimeter, period/unit discipline and text-fidelity limitations |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 20","text":"| CP-1 | `2ec4b36a3bec9bd872ff53b9c31628ab59551a3eed5ed7c11501e06006b42891` | Canonical reported financials, checked calculations, debt/facility observations, dated subsequent events and unresolved alignments |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 21","text":"| CP-1A | `ac6631243ca71cda10dcdafcc5696a3393c9617b61c49bdfe8e94d2d5a33f955` | Business B01\u2013B14, ownership O01\u2013O05, transactions X00\u2013X07, governance GT/BF registers, CT01\u2013CT05, conflicts C01\u2013C05 and limitations |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 23","text":"CP-1 controls financial amounts and definitions; CP-1A supplies the business and action evidence. CP-0 readine