ields":[{"name":"Source","value":"CP-6"},{"name":"Locator","value":"line 173"},{"name":"Quote","value":"P1 defense: CP-3 correctly distinguishes margins, coupons, calls and historical issue prices, so a matched comparison is feasible research rather than a false value signal; **Partially Rebutted**, with no present compensation conclusion. P2 defense: L \u00a7\u00a79.02/10.01 supplies real protections, not simply a senior label; **Partially Rebutted**, because price and asset-level reach remain unverified. P3 defense: CP-3 explicitly recognizes a possible value-order reversal rather than ranking all junior debt Avoid; **Insufficient Information** to rebut the implementation gate because neither entry price nor residual/mandate evidence is supplied. Proposed size is **Not calculable \u2014 trade, vehicle and risk-budget operands Not supplied**, not an invented zero."},{"name":"SHA-256","value":"cfd965c46e884cc6f8763a14119d843e305d95955d68587795f0e0658dd6c773"}]},{"ref_id":"C1311","kind":"cited","fields":[{"name":"Source","value":"CP-6"},{"name":"Locator","value":"line 177"},{"name":"Quote","value":"Same 1\u20135 direction as the supplied portfolio method: 1 RV clearly superior, 5 Compliance clearly superior. Overall Provisional; no partial average or numerical allocation rating."},{"name":"SHA-256","value":"cfd965c46e884cc6f8763a14119d843e305d95955d68587795f0e0658dd6c773"}]},{"ref_id":"C1312","kind":"cited","fields":[{"name":"Source","value":"CP-6"},{"name":"Locator","value":"line 201"},{"name":"Quote","value":"**Final portfolio posture: Requires More Work.** No definitive size can be computed. **Exact binding portfolio constraint: Not supplied \u2014 mandate, exposure and risk-budget evidence are absent.** Data quality is a research/implementation gate, not proof that a vehicle's binding constraint is Data quality, Mandate or Liquidity. Secondary issuer risks remain extraction, conditional legal flexibility, refinancing and sector cash conversion; none is turned int